WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Ask Lylo a question about your case.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
It searches the files, finds the answer,

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.300
and shows you the exact source it used.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.000
First, add the case file to Lylo.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.300
Once it is loaded, you can ask a simple question about the case.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.000
Here, we ask for the key legal issues.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Lylo reads the file and gives a clear answer.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.600
Each point has a citation, so you can see where the information came from.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.300
Click one, and Lylo opens the source text

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.900
so you can check the exact part of the document it used.
